            </style></head><body><div xmlns="" class="page-wrapper"><h2 class="auth__title">Заявление на предоставление отпуска без сохранения заработной платы</h2><div class="doc-snippet">
  Когда понадобится: при составлении заявления на отпуск без сохранения заработной платы 
</div><div class="page-box" id="doc-box"><div class="doc-page"><div id="documentConftent" class="content content-form"><div align="right"><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="vertical-align: top;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas4t390c/" data-dfa="dfas4t390c"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr1/"></a>Директору<span id="sfwc_1" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas4z5agu/" data-dfa="dfas4z5agu"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr2/"></a>Укажите занимаемую должность<br>лица, которому пишите</span></span>&nbsp;ООО «Барка Савдо» <span id="sfwc_2" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas5tyg30/" data-dfa="dfas5tyg30"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr3/"></a>Укажите наименование<br>организации куда пишите</span></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Г.Г. Ибрагимову <span id="sfwc_3" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfasnx6x3z/" data-dfa="dfasnx6x3z"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr4/"></a>Укажите ФИО должностного лица<br>к кому обращаетесь</span></span><br>&nbsp;от экономиста А.С.Умарова </span><span id="sfwc_4" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas1dhdge/" data-dfa="dfas1dhdge"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr5/"></a>Укажите свою занимаемую должность и свои ФИО</span></span></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 272pt;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr6/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas0mzwz2/" data-dfa="dfas0mzwz2"></a>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr7/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas9ap4sa/" data-dfa="dfas9ap4sa"></a>Заявление</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr8/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfasix71hy/" data-dfa="dfasix71hy"></a>Прошу предоставить мне отпуск без сохранения заработной платы по семейным обстоятельствам&nbsp;на срок с <span class="fill"><span class="fill">06.04.<span class="fill"><year>2026</year></span></span></span>&nbsp;г. по <span class="fill"><span class="fill">16.04.<span class="fill"><year>2026</year></span></span></span>&nbsp;года.<span id="sfwc_5" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas0pd9hf/" data-dfa="dfas0pd9hf"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr9/"></a>Укажите на какой период берется отпуск</span></span></p><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr10/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas794ate/" data-dfa="dfas794ate"></a>А.С. Умаров</span></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr11/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas1twhr3/" data-dfa="dfas1twhr3"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas5rf3os/" data-dfa="dfas5rf3os"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr12/"></a> Умаров<span id="sfwc_6" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfasecx3n5/" data-dfa="dfasecx3n5"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr13/"></a>Укажите ФИО и подпись лица<br>написавшего заявление</span></span></span></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr14/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfasvd2p34/" data-dfa="dfasvd2p34"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfasrvabvl/" data-dfa="dfasrvabvl"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr15/"></a><strong>&nbsp; <span id="sfwc_7" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas53mbe2/" data-dfa="dfas53mbe2"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr16/"></a>Укажите дату написания заявления</span></span></strong><span class="fill"><span class="fill">31.03.<span class="fill"><year>2026</year></span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr17/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfasbykh5t/" data-dfa="dfasbykh5t"></a><sup>(Ф.И.О.)</sup></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr18/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfasxi3vbr/" data-dfa="dfasxi3vbr"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdTop" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr19/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfasyugls3/" data-dfa="dfasyugls3"></a><sup>(подпись)</sup></td><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr20/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfasvu5fzu/" data-dfa="dfasvu5fzu"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdTop" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr21/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfasgezqvt/" data-dfa="dfasgezqvt"></a><sup>(Дата)</sup></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 235pt;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr22/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfascvcbkm/" data-dfa="dfascvcbkm"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width: 48pt;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr23/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas169n9i/" data-dfa="dfas169n9i"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width: 152pt;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr24/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfasapvd97/" data-dfa="dfasapvd97"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width: 48pt;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr25/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfassutmgx/" data-dfa="dfassutmgx"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width: 159pt;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/bssPhr26/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201836/dfas4su88u/" data-dfa="dfas4su88u"></a>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="footer">© Материал из ЭС "ACTION: Главбух"<br />https://1gb.uz<br />Дата копирования: 29.09.2026</div></div></div></div></body></html>